\",\"data\":\"Some analysts predicted the Thunder would win the series in five or six games, citing their ability to dominate in the paint and on the glass.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF5F51H1VqkcyLRL5BoEgLCZk0M7QJdU53eZshGJ4W4zXX2ZNsDwFbHkX1WwoFaLWzvOKBXvhiVcQTrxPziJ8gFMiwLH6ZLaL3IhJHohQVfIuLOY0R0PiC2G_9oXBFV4NI_ZgDIHcwhei5VqOUqxq-D4rkH3LSBkDl5nZXmKHJwkn1UzL0YTd0QeAQpRzfPRnCk5qononyL0CMmyz3S4Q==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784281501,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"2036a761-f7d5-42a1-9d10-48e8c16aca7f\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":22,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"ftnfantasy.com\",\"data\":\"Some analysts predicted the Thunder would win the series in five or six games, citing their ability to dominate in the paint and on the glass.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH3tzkzltt7_U1IiaU9FdWLEj6c5XXt4Sd2SM7vSNlKHzkXhGM-gtFBemNzetAc9YhZJQL2YPSeFV7gP0GrIzF0tBX_RpVnFwAa-kQVNOZjOUYrUqqKnihXx6M3VikGMtJ4E7KAT4q6ocSlRFfj-g4oTlpLhmAx-NWHXJA72mvpA7TeE2WuebSazT2DZmyOjbSwOYqhFHu0NMCtdRu4\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784281501,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"2036a761-f7d5-42a1-9d10-48e8c16aca7f\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":23,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"cbssports.com\",\"data\":\"One expert even suggested a score prediction for a decisive Game 7, with the Thunder winning 105-97.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFKzk8D1Nh09rddLL8CKtEKiS3yia2rOc7a7rII1baOI8EXlRE1PHcfDnIXSpPZeiXNePoPAU4m5_J1A7ETU2CaVz4mhTf-rODPNEcVhk_qFrEFK09xv5bLKhg9cJVMub2